  "project_description": "This module provides an option for user-specific range as the processor for Search API \n\n The possible values this field can contain. Enter one value per line, in the format key|label.\n\nThe key must be numeric range. The label will be used in display values of facet.\n\n For example .\n\n0-20|0-20 Minutes.\n\n20-40|20-40 Minutes\n\n40-999|40+ Minutes",
